# Strategy parameters

Do not add constants used by signal/risk logic inside strategy implementations. Every knob belongs on the mode params object (`BollingerParams`, `DonchianParams`) and is set in `*ParamsFor(trend, volatility)`.

Regime lookup tables (`ADX_MAX`, volume SMA multipliers, …) are allowed only as the mapping that **fills** those params. `evaluate*` / `evaluateBollinger` / `evaluateDonchian` must read `params.foo`, not a module `FOO`.

```typescript
// BAD
const RECLAIM_DEPTH = 0.15;
if (depth < RECLAIM_DEPTH) return hold;

// GOOD
if (depth < params.minReclaimDepth) return hold;
```
